<div class="ux-panel"><div class="ux-subtabs"><div class="ux-subtabs-list" role="tablist" aria-label="Settings sections"><button id="_r_-tab-settings-policies" type="button" role="tab" class="ux-subtabs-tab" data-tab="settings-policies" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="_r_-panel-settings-policies" tabindex="0">Routes and settings</button><button id="_r_-tab-settings-erasure" type="button" role="tab" class="ux-subtabs-tab" data-tab="settings-erasure" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="_r_-panel-settings-erasure" tabindex="-1">Erasure requests</button></div><div id="_r_-panel-settings-policies" role="tabpanel" class="ux-subtabs-panel" data-subtab="settings-policies" aria-labelledby="_r_-tab-settings-policies"><section data-operator-workbench="true" id="workspace-settings" tabindex="-1" class="operator-section workspace-panel" aria-label="Corridor and policy settings"><header class="ux-panel-heading"><span class="ux-panel-heading-icon"><svg class="corridra-icon operator-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10 3a7 7 0 1 0 0 14 7 7 0 1 0 0-14M10 3c-2.5 2-3.5 4.5-3.5 7s1 5 3.5 7M10 3c2.5 2 3.5 4.5 3.5 7s-1 5-3.5 7M3 10h14"></path></svg></span><div><p class="eyebrow">Settings and access</p><h2>Corridors and reviewed policies</h2><p>Prepare mission templates, define a route and review the policies that govern its use.</p></div></header><nav class="ux-operator-workbench" aria-label="Reviewed configuration sections"><p class="label">JUMP TO</p><button class="ux-workbench-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_">Show Jump Links (4)</button><div id="_r_" data-shown="false"><button class="text-link" type="button">Mission templates</button><button class="text-link" type="button">Directional route</button><button class="text-link" type="button">Source rights and model policies</button><button class="text-link" type="button">Pinned configuration references</button></div></nav><div class="ux-settings-head"><p>Owner and admin reviews use existing versioned commands. Source, country, currency, permission and authenticator checks still apply. Use only records and actions approved for this workspace.</p><div class="workspace-links"><a href="#workspace-navigation">Back to workspace sections</a><a href="#workspace-sources">Find source references</a><a href="#workspace-authenticator">Confirm your authenticator</a><a href="#workspace-controls">Workspace switches</a></div></div><p role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="ux-settings-refresh"><button class="text-link" aria-busy="false">Refresh Reviewed Configuration</button><dl class="ux-settings-counts"><div><dt>Routes returned</dt><dd>3</dd></div><div><dt>Route packs returned</dt><dd>3</dd></div><div><dt>Mission types returned</dt><dd>1</dd></div></dl></div><div class="ux-settings-sections"><details><summary data-step="01">Prepare commercial mission templates</summary><p>Install the existing generic mission, requirement and assessment definitions. This does not create customer missions or approve a corridor.</p><button class="text-link">Install Missing Mission Templates</button></details><details><summary data-step="02">Create a directional corridor route</summary><form class="operator-form"><label class="field">Demand-origin market<select name="origin" required=""><option value="">Choose a market</option><option value="AF">Afghanistan</option><option value="AX">Åland Islands</option><option value="AL">Albania</option><option value="DZ">Algeria</option><option value="AS">American Samoa</option><option value="AD">Andorra</option><option value="AO">Angola</option><option value="AI">Anguilla</option><option value="AQ">Antarctica</option><option value="AG">Antigua &amp; Barbuda</option><option value="AR">Argentina</option><option value="AM">Armenia</option><option value="AW">Aruba</option><option value="AU">Australia</option><option va